msgid ""
"Define custom fields to capture additional information on Leads and "
"Opportunities."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan bidang khusus untuk mendapatkan informasi tambahan tentang Prospek "
"dan Peluang."

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nama"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "Jenis"

msgid "Order"
msgstr "Memesan"

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Sunting"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Hapus"

msgid ""
"Define extra fields on Leads and Opportunities. Configure them in Settings "
"and use them on create/edit forms, detail views, list columns, filters, and "
"exports."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan bidang tambahan pada Prospek dan Peluang.Konfigurasikan di "
"Pengaturan dan gunakan pada pembuatan/edit formulir, tampilan detail, kolom "
"daftar, filter, dan ekspor."

msgid ""
"Add a Custom Fields settings app for Leads and Opportunities. Support small "
"text, large text, number, and multiple choice fields. Inject values into "
"create/edit forms, detail views, list columns, record filters, and exports "
"without changing Horilla core."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan aplikasi pengaturan Bidang Khusus untuk Prospek dan "
"Peluang.Mendukung bidang teks kecil, teks besar, angka, dan pilihan "
"ganda.Menyuntikkan nilai ke dalam formulir buat/edit, tampilan detail, kolom"
" daftar, filter rekaman, dan ekspor tanpa mengubah inti Horilla."
